  "title": "Check an order"
 },
 "description": "Return an order's state and the next actions open to the token's holder, buyer or seller. Not read-only: each call runs a rate-limited check of the domain move and, when the terms are met, may release the payment to the seller. That is the order proceeding, not an extra charge. Poll no faster than pollAfterSeconds. Use act_on_order instead to confirm, dispute or refund; this tool only reports state and triggers the check.",
